<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His target's the Secret Manuscript.</font>

134
00:07:35,470 --> 00:07:36,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Backup Mizuki!</font>

135
00:07:36,890 --> 00:07:37,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

136
00:07:42,730 --> 00:07:44,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Are you all right?!</font>

137
00:07:44,940 --> 00:07:49,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I can't feel my leg...</font>

138
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think, Mizuki?</font>

139
00:07:57,490 --> 00:08:00,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good.
It's unfortunate, but he can no longer...</font>

140
00:08:00,870 --> 00:08:01,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

141
00:08:03,710 --> 00:08:05,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Let's withdraw!</font>

142
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:07,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry!
Yeah...</font>

143
00:08:13,220 --> 00:08:14,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's unfortunate, but...</font>

144
00:08:14,970 --> 00:08:16,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guys who are of no use
on the battleground</font>

145
00:08:17,050 --> 00:08:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only become a ball and chain...</font>

146
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:21,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though it's just a minor injury,</font>

147
00:08:21,140 --> 00:08:23,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you won't be able to move
from this place...</font>

148
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:24,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're wanna blame someone,</font>

149
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I suggest you blame
your own helpless self!</font>

150
00:08:29,610 --> 00:08:32,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I simply carried out
my mission faithfully.</font>

151
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:37,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And despite that, those guys
in the village...</font>

152
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:40,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not one of them even attempted
to acknowledge me...</font>

153
00:08:40,910 --> 00:08:45,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?! Why didn't anybody
acknowledge my strength?!</font>

154
00:08:45,620 --> 00:08:47,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?! Iruka...!</font>

155
00:08:48,250 --> 00:08:54,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you and even that Nine-Tailed brat
are acknowledged, why only me...?</font>

156
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:57,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's still not too late.</font>

157
00:08:57,470 --> 00:09:00,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you pay for your crimes
and start afresh,</font>

158
00:09:00,180 --> 00:09:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the people in the village will certainly...</font>

159
00:09:02,850 --> 00:09:07,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How cocky! Don't preach to me!</font>

160
00:09:08,150 --> 00:09:11,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're just the same as
those other guys in the village!</font>

161
00:09:11,570 --> 00:09:13,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You disdain me, don't you?!</font>

162
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:15,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki...</font>

163
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:16,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything...</font>

164
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:19,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...
Everything began that day...</font>

165
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:28,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you gonna do,
getting nervous now?</font>

166
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:30,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki...</font>

167
00:09:31,170 --> 00:09:33,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It finally takes place tomorrow,
doesn't it?</font>

168
00:09:33,130 --> 00:09:35,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Academy's teacher
recruitment exam...</font>

169
00:09:35,970 --> 00:09:38,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... It's weighing heavily on me.</font>

170
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:41,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm envious of you.
Your scores are better than mine.</font>

171
00:09:42,310 --> 00:09:44,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll breeze right through
tomorrow's exam.</font>

172
00:09:46,100 --> 00:09:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not quite... Well, in any case,
let's both do our best!</font>

173
00:09:50,860 --> 00:09:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

174
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

175
00:10:14,130 --> 00:10:14,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lie low!</font>

176
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:18,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close, Iruka!</font>

177
00:10:18,630 --> 00:10:19,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

178
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:22,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki... Thank you.
You really helped me out!</font>

179
00:10:22,890 --> 00:10:25,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's mutual...
Come on, let's hurry!</font>

180
00:10:26,230 --> 00:10:32,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Academy
Exam Results</font>

181
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:37,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Number 7 - Iruka Umino</font>

182
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I did it...</font>

183
00:10:39,660 --> 00:10:40,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it!</font>

184
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki...</font>

185
00:10:44,620 --> 00:10:47,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Exam Office</font>

186
00:10:47,580 --> 00:10:51,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, regarding Mizuki...
we will adopt a wait-and-see attitude.</font>

187
00:10:52,380 --> 00:10:54,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, it can't be helped.</font>

188
00:10:55,670 --> 00:10:58,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I agree...
The questions that were raised</font>

189
00:10:58,260 --> 00:11:00,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">at the time of that mission to
recover the Secret Manuscript...</font>

190
00:11:01,470 --> 00:11:05,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until those are completely cleared up...
It can't be helped, can it?</font>

191
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">According to the autopsy report...</font>

192
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:11,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the cause of death to that corpse
was given as suffocation.</font>

193
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:13,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In Mizuki and the others' reports,</font>

194
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:17,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it stated that the leg injury
was not that serious...</font>

195
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:19,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand...</font>

196
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:22,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's brilliant but it can't be helped.</font>

197
00:11:28,290 --> 00:11:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was just carrying out the mission
that I was assigned to do!</font>

198
00:11:33,420 --> 00:11:39,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you understand how miserable
the life I've led has been since then?!</font>

199
00:11:39,420 --> 00:11:42,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Iruka?!</font>

200
00:11:43,010 --> 00:11:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have no idea, do you?</font>

201
00:11:46,810 --> 00:11:48,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have undergone
so many hardships,</font>

202
00:11:48,430 --> 00:11:50,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you, who has had it so easy...</font>

203
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which one of us is the true Shinobi...</font>

204
00:11:52,980 --> 00:11:54,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's clarify that once and for all,
shall we?!</font>

205
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:05,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then come! Iruka!</font>

206
00:12:11,710 --> 00:12:13,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki... Where are you?!</font>

207
00:12:14,460 --> 00:12:17,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have any intention
of reforming yourself, do you?!</font>

208
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:20,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't make me say the same thing
over and over again!</font>

209
00:12:21,340 --> 00:12:23,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll bring this to an end now...</font>

210
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:25,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's very unfortunate, though!</font>

211
00:12:27,140 --> 00:12:28,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a tearjerker...</font>

212
00:12:28,510 --> 00:12:30,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It makes me happy too, Iruka...</font>

213
00:12:43,070 --> 00:12:45,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother?!
What's the matter, Elder Brother?!</font>

214
00:12:46,950 --> 00:12:50,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... You came back, Elder Brother!</font>

215
00:12:51,330 --> 00:12:52,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, Elder Brother?</font>

216
00:12:56,790 --> 00:12:59,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you guys do to...
to Elder Brother?!</font>

217
00:13:00,090 --> 00:13:03,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hijacked him! Idiot!</font>

218
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:07,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What the heck...?!</font>

219
00:13:07,510 --> 00:13:08,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

220
00:13:08,510 --> 00:13:13,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother! Get up! Wake up!</font>

221
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:18,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys!</font>

222
00:13:20,230 --> 00:13:21,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Owww...!</font>

223
00:13:21,980 --> 00:13:23,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay, Ino?</font>

224
00:13:23,690 --> 00:13:26,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I think I'm...</font>

225
00:13:26,950 --> 00:13:30,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not okay! My gorgeous face is...!</font>

226
00:13:32,700 --> 00:13:35,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good grief... Gimme a break...</font>

227
00:13:36,620 --> 00:13:37,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C-Choji!</font>

228
00:13:40,210 --> 00:13:41,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji!</font>

229
00:13:42,590 --> 00:13:43,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?!</font>

230
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm fine...</font>

231
00:13:46,010 --> 00:13:49,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry... Feels like I fell asleep a little.</font>

232
00:13:49,430 --> 00:13:52,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Elder Brother... You woke up.</font>

233
00:13:52,680 --> 00:13:54,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn. Can't be helped...</font>

234
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:56,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guess I have no choice but to use
that thing.</font>

235
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:59,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Strangle Jutsu!</font>

236
00:14:04,990 --> 00:14:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother...!</font>

237
00:14:06,610 --> 00:14:08,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-How dare you!</font>

238
00:14:14,750 --> 00:14:19,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're close. Mizuki may have
set a trap so be careful!</font>

239
00:14:19,460 --> 00:14:20,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that!</font>

240
00:14:30,890 --> 00:14:33,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was so much fun to be behind bars...</font>

241
00:14:35,470 --> 00:14:38,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The moldiness... The dampness...
The gloominess...</font>

242
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:46,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pitch black year round!</font>

243
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:53,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But for that very reason that
I was able master techniques</font>

244
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:55,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that an ordinary Shinobi would
not be able to possess...</font>

245
00:14:56,250 --> 00:14:57,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even in this darkness...</font>

246
00:14:57,500 --> 00:14:59,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can get an intense sense
of your energy...</font>

247
00:15:06,210 --> 00:15:08,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?
Are you done already?</font>

248
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:15,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time to be spaced out, Iruka.</font>

249
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:18,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna take my time
and have fun with this...</font>

250
00:15:18,180 --> 00:15:19,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take my time, got it?</font>

251
00:15:30,650 --> 00:15:32,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Me too!</font>

252
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:35,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait! If you go in there right now
using Mind Transfer Jutsu,</font>

253
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:37,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my Jutsu will affect you too!</font>

254
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:42,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you think you're the only one
who's learned a new Jutsu,</font>

255
00:15:42,580 --> 00:15:44,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're very wrong!</font>

256
00:15:45,710 --> 00:15:47,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art:</font>

257
00:15:47,090 --> 00:15:49,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mind Destruction Jutsu!</font>

258
00:15:54,010 --> 00:15:56,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What's the matter, Raijin?!</font>

259
00:16:01,230 --> 00:16:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Raijin... What are you doing?!</font>

260
00:16:04,690 --> 00:16:06,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh... Not bad...</font>

261
00:16:08,070 --> 00:16:10,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Ino collection,"
my new spring season Jutsu!</font>

262
00:16:19,290 --> 00:16:20,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're close!</font>

263
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:26,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it! That building!</font>

264
00:16:26,380 --> 00:16:29,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Just one last spurt!</font>

265
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:48,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about it?
Have your eyes adjusted a little?</font>

266
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:51,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For guys like you who have lived
their lives in the light,</font>

267
00:16:52,030 --> 00:16:54,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">darkness is an inconvenience, isn't it?</font>

268
00:17:01,040 --> 00:17:02,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Where are you?!</font>

269
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:14,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Iruka, weren't you saying that</font>

270
00:17:14,220 --> 00:17:17,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you were going to bring this
to an end?</font>

271
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:21,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see! By end,</font>

272
00:17:21,180 --> 00:17:23,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you must have been
talking about yourself, huh?!</font>

273
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:33,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh! Just a little bit!</font>

274
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:35,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there, Ino!</font>

275
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:36,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me!</font>

276
00:17:37,410 --> 00:17:40,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...!</font>

277
00:17:45,370 --> 00:17:47,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Unbelievable idiot strength!</font>

278
00:17:48,330 --> 00:17:50,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-Those jerks...</font>

279
00:17:56,130 --> 00:17:58,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I can't hold them any longer!</font>

280
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:02,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we put a stop to the Jutsu right now,
everything will go to waste...</font>

281
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:04,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Think... Think about the next move...</font>

282
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bear with it, Ino!</font>

283
00:18:12,150 --> 00:18:13,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me!</font>

284
00:18:13,610 --> 00:18:15,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're just gonna be
sent flying again!</font>

285
00:18:16,070 --> 00:18:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino, just be quiet and watch!</font>

286
00:18:18,610 --> 00:18:20,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even the big-boned guy can make
quite a showing once he decides to do it!</font>

287
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:29,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Partial Expansion Jutsu!</font>

288
00:18:29,460 --> 00:18:31,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both Hands!</font>

289
00:18:39,510 --> 00:18:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji...</font>

290
00:18:40,550 --> 00:18:44,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't let just Ino get
all the good parts!</font>

291
00:18:45,770 --> 00:18:50,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the number one handsome
Big-Boned Ninja!</font>

292
00:18:50,730 --> 00:18:53,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good work, Choji! You're so cool!</font>

293
